[8:45p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is good coming in from Oshodi inward Brown junction to Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport bus stop, National, up the Ikeja Overpass to Ajayi Farm and Ile-Zik.

Our Men are strategically located, ensuring traffic is good.

Remember to drive with care because #LASTMACares
