Traffic from Ketu inwards Iyana School, Kosofe, Mile 12, Owode (Elede and Onirin), Idera, Ajegunle, Odogun, Itowolo, Majidun is all good, but starts getting slow approaching Ogolonto.

Moving to Auty Kenny, and Agric is also good.

Our Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is good.

